 provided that all the opponents' trump is drawn first."],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["ls","eh"],["hs","sc"],["nt","Since discarding a Club loser is a sure way to make the contract, it would seem that you should just plan to draw trump and then discard your loser. "],["pg",""],["ls","sc"],["hs","eh"],["at","There is a danger. If East started with three Hearts including the @HQ, "],["pg",""],["ls","eh"],["hs","ec"],["at","he willl be able to lead a Club "],["pg",""],["ls","ec"],["hc","hq"],["at","when he wins the @HQ - East is a dangerous opponent. "],["pg",""],["lc","hq"],["hs","ec"],["at","East can lead a Club "],["pg",""],["ls","ec"],["hc","ca"],["at","and if West has the @CA, "],["pg",""],["lc","ca"],["hc","ck"],["at","your @CK "],["pg",""],["lc","ck"],["hs","wc"],["hs","ec"],["at","is trapped. "],["pg",""],["ls","wc"],["ls","ec"],["hs","sc"],["at","You will lose three Club tricks "],["pg",""],["ls","sc"],["hc","hq"],["at","in addition to the trump trick. "],["pg",""],["lc","hq"],["hc","ca"],["nt","\nOn the other hand, if you lose a trump trick to West, there is no such danger. West can take the @CA, "],["pg",""],["lc","ca"],["hc","ck"],["at","but your @CK will be able to win the next trick. "],["pg",""],["lc","ck"],["hs","wh"],["hs","eh"],["at","After drawing any remaining trump, "],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["ls","eh"],["hs","sc"],["at","you can safely discard your other Club loser "],["pg",""],["ls","sc"],["hs","ns"],["at","on the extra Spade winner."],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["hc","da"],["nt","\nThe safest plan is to win the @DA "],["pg",""],["lc","da"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pc","da"],["pg",""],["hc","hk"],["at","and take the @HK "],["pg",""],["lc","hk"],["hc","ha"],["at","or @HA "],["pg",""],["lc","ha"],["pc","ha"],["md","0,hq,,h2"],["hc","hq"],["at","in case one of the opponents has a singleton @HQ. "],["pg",""],["md","0,h2,,hq"],["at","If the @HQ does not appear, "],["pg",""],["lc","hq"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","nd"],["at","use one of your entries to the dummy "],["pg",""],["ls","nd"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","nh"],["at","to lead a Heart "],["pg",""],["ls","nh"],["pc","h"],["hs","sh"],["at","toward your hand. "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["hs","eh"],["at","If East plays a small card, "],["pg",""],["ls","eh"],["pc","h"],["hc","hj"],["at","play the @HJ. "],["pg",""],["lc","hj"],["pc","hj"],["md","0,hq,,s5"],["hc","hq"],["at","If West wins the @HQ, he can do you no damage. "],["pg",""],["lc","hq"],["pc","hq"],["pg",""],["hs","ns"],["hs","sc"],["at","You will be able to discard a Club loser and make your contract."],["",""]]}}